//github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/entity/fluid/PipeCheckValveBlockEntity.java#L7" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">类型声明</a></p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>成员签名</th><th>实现与调用约定</th><th>源码</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>public PipeCheckValveBlockEntity(BlockEntityType&lt;?&gt; type, BlockPos pos, BlockState blockState)</code></td><td>执行 <code>super(type, pos, blockState)</code><br><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PipeBlock.java#L256" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">调用处 PipeBlock.newBlockEntity</a></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/entity/fluid/PipeCheckValveBlockEntity.java#L8" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">构造器</a></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="pumpblockentity" tabindex="-1">PumpBlockEntity <a class="header-anchor" href="#pumpblockentity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;PumpBlockEntity&quot;">​</a></h2><p><code>public class PumpBlockEntity extends AbstractPipeBlockEntity implements IPowerConsumer</code></p><p><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/entity/fluid/PumpBlockEntity.java#L38" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">类型声明</a></p><p>泵的 BlockEntity。消费 32kW 电力，为流体网络提供输出侧 +10 / 输入侧 -10 的等效高度势场。 重构后泵 不再自行搬运流体 ：它只作为网络中的一条&quot;有向势能边&quot;，实际流体 分配由 dev.dubhe.anvilcraft.api.fluid.network.FluidPipeNetwork 统一执行。 本 tick 仅刷新电力/红石/过载状态并据此决定 #canPump()。 工作状态判定： 有红石信号 → 关闭（阻断网络连接） 电网过载 → 关闭（阻断网络连接） 正常供电 → 工作（提供势场） 方向映射：dev.dubhe.anvilcraft.block.state.Orientation#getDirection() 返回输出方向， 该侧等效高度 +10；反向（输入侧）-10。</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>成员签名</th><th>实现与调用约定</th><th>源码</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>public static final int PUMP_HEADLIFT</code></td><td>初值 <code>10</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/entity/fluid/PumpBlockEntity.java#L42" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">字段</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>public PumpBlockEntity(BlockEntityType&lt;? extends PumpBlockEntity&gt; type, BlockPos pos, BlockState state)</code></td><td>执行 <code>super(type, pos, state)</code><br><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/entity/fluid/PumpBlockEntity.java#L54" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">调用处 PumpBlockEntity.create</a></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/entity/fluid/PumpBlockEntity.java#L49" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">构造器</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>public static PumpBlockEntity create(BlockEntityType&lt;PumpBlockEntity&gt; type, BlockPos pos, BlockState state)</code></td><td>末尾返回 <code>new PumpBlockEntity(type, pos, state)</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/entity/fluid/PumpBlockEntity.java#L53" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public int getInputPower()</code></td><td>末尾返回 <code>getBlockState().getValue(PumpBlock.POWERED) ? 0 : PUMP_POWER</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/entity/fluid/PumpBlockEntity.java#L57" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public @Nullable Level getCurrentLevel()</code></td><td>末尾返回 <code>getLevel()</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/entity/fluid/PumpBlockEntity.java#L62" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public BlockPos getPos()</code></td><td>末尾返回 <code>getBlockPos()</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/entity/fluid/PumpBlockEntity.java#L67" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>public boolean canPump()</code></td><td>泵是否能实际泵送流体（启用 + 电网有电）<br>末尾返回 <code>this.working &amp;&amp; this.grid != null &amp;&amp; this.grid.isWorking()</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/entity/fluid/PumpBlockEntity.java#L75" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public void loadAdditional(CompoundTag tag, HolderLookup.Provider registries)</code></td><td>从存档恢复方块实体附加数据时调用。<br>实现调用 <code>super.loadAdditional(tag, registries)</code><br>实现调用 <code>tag.getBoolean(&quot;Working&quot;)</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/entity/fluid/PumpBlockEntity.java#L87" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public CompoundTag getUpdateTag(HolderLookup.Provider registries)</code></td><td>构造区块发往客户端时附带的方块实体同步数据。<br>末尾返回 <code>tag</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/entity/fluid/PumpBlockEntity.java#L93" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Nullable @Override public Packet&lt;ClientGamePacketListener&gt; getUpdatePacket()</code></td><td>末尾返回 <code>ClientboundBlockEntityDataPacket.create(this)</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/6a4cde43b4ece65b765137a7aab145b9b4c002bf/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/entity/fluid/PumpBlockEnt